This instance runs [https://github.com/Rokurolize/wikijump Wikijump], which renders Wikidot syntax and serves Wikidot-compatible sites.

+ Writing pages

* [http://www.wikidot.com/doc-wiki-syntax:start Wikidot syntax documentation]: the markup used on every wiki here.
* [http://www.wikidot.com/doc-modules:start Wikidot modules]: ListPages, Rate and the other modules pages can use.

